-# Shown when a digest figure sent you here. Without it the list is silently
-# short and there is no way back to the whole thing — the reader has no idea a
-# filter is on, only that there is less here than they expected.
- if @on
  .px-3.pb-2
    %span.ledger-day-filter
      %i.fa-solid.fa-calendar-day{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
      = "Only #{@on.strftime('%B %-d, %Y')}"
      = link_to admin_ledger_path(tab: @tab, kind: @kind), class: 'ledger-day-filter__clear',
        'aria-label' => 'Show every day' do
        %i.fa-solid.fa-xmark{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
